      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着终于就是“日本德比”了……\n我不禁诚心盼望她能够\n写成一本精彩无比的英雄传说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af159d31a8aae27842f2de3bf4bee9b782fb8ba2ea6fc3524bafcc9a66782a1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
