      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我上一秒才刚称赞完比赛很精彩，\n便立刻听从她的指示翻开《荒漠英雄传说》。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "a226fb63ea3aa9534ca85de4b47e253b05c0b249a593083c2b5c22695d65bed7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
